Name: sockstat
Description: list open sockets
URL: https://man.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sockstat&manpath=FreeBSD+15.0-RELEASE
Version: 15.0
License: NOASSERTION
Source: https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/usr.bin/sockstat?h=stable/15
